  {
   "id": "B01",
   "segments": [
    {
     "text": "100円ショップは、なぜ全部100円なのか？",
     "start": 0.11538461538461538,
     "end": 2.631842948717949
    }
   ],
   "voice": "case001_shorts/short2/voice/B01.wav",
   "voiceStart": 0.11538461538461538,
   "from": 0,
   "duration": 86
  },
  {
   "id": "B02",
   "segments": [
    {
     "text": "始まりは、1970年代。",
     "start": 0.15384615384615385,
     "end": 2.4047003205128203
    }
   ],
   "voice": "case001_shorts/short2/voice/B02.wav",
   "voiceStart": 0.15384615384615385,
   "from": 86,
   "duration": 79
  },
  {
   "id": "B03",
   "segments": [
    {
     "text": "DAISOの創業者、矢野博丈は、",
     "start": 0.15384615384615385,
     "end": 2.177408653846154
    },
    {
     "text": "店を持たず、各地を回って商品を売っていた。",
     "start": 2.3312548076923076,
     "end": 4.904671474358974
    },
    {
     "text": "移動販売だ。",
     "start": 5.058517628205129,
     "end": 5.887163461538462
    }
   ],
   "voice": "case001_shorts/short2/voice/B03.wav",
   "voiceStart": 0.15384615384615385,
   "from": 165,
   "duration": 184
  },
  {
   "id": "B04",
   "segments": [
    {
     "text": "商品ごとに値段が違うから、",
     "start": 0.15384615384615385,
     "end": 1.780491987179487
    },
    {
     "text": "お客さんに次々と値段を聞かれる。",
     "start": 1.9343381410256408,
     "end": 3.7787131410256407
    },
    {
     "text": "忙しい売り場で、そのたびに答えるのは大変だった。",
     "start": 3.932559294871795,
     "end": 6.740642628205128
    }
   ],
   "voice": "case001_shorts/short2/voice/B04.wav",
   "voiceStart": 0.15384615384615385,
   "from": 349,
   "duration": 209
  },
  {
   "id": "B05",
   "segments": [
    {
     "text": "そこで生まれたのが――",
     "start": 0.15384615384615385,
     "end": 1.1588669871794872
    },
    {
     "text": "「全部、同じ値段にしてしまう」という発想だった。",
     "start": 1.5434823717948718,
     "end": 4.449628205128205
    }
   ],
   "voice": "case001_shorts/short2/voice/B05.wav",
   "voiceStart": 0.15384615384615385,
   "from": 558,
   "duration": 145
  },
  {
   "id": "B06",
   "segments": [
    {
     "text": "でも、本当にすごいのはここからだ。",
     "start": 0.15384615384615385,
     "end": 2.2188669871794873
    }
   ],
   "voice": "case001_shorts/short2/voice/B06.wav",
   "voiceStart": 0.15384615384615385,
   "from": 703,
   "duration": 73
  },
  {
   "id": "B07",
   "segments": [
    {
     "text": "先に100円という値段を決めて、",
     "start": 0.15384615384615385,
     "end": 1.8960544871794873
    },
    {
     "text": "その値段で売れる商品を探し、作り、運び、並べる。",
     "start": 2.049900641025641,
     "end": 5.573108974358974
    }
   ],
   "voice": "case001_shorts/short2/voice/B07.wav",
   "voiceStart": 0.15384615384615385,
   "from": 776,
   "duration": 174
  },
  {
   "id": "B08",
   "segments": [
    {
     "text": "商品を100円にしたのではない。",
     "start": 0.15384615384615385,
     "end": 1.8148253205128206
    },
    {
     "text": "商売そのものを、100円で成り立つように作り変えたのだ。",
     "start": 2.0302099358974357,
     "end": 5.180022435897436
    }
   ],
   "voice": "case001_shorts/short2/voice/B08.wav",
   "voiceStart": 0.15384615384615385,
   "from": 950,
   "duration": 167
  },
  {
   "id": "B09",
   "segments": [
    {
     "text": "では、どうやって？",
     "start": 0.15384615384615385,
     "end": 1.5331169871794872
    },
    {
     "text": "続きは本編で。",
     "start": 1.9177323717948718,
     "end": 2.970878205128205
    },
    {
     "text": "カネナゾ。",
     "start": 3.18626282051282,
     "end": 3.7702211538461534
    }
   ],
   "voice": "case001_shorts/short2/voice/B09.wav",
   "voiceStart": 0.15384615384615385,
